&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Operations Partner is a critical logistical role essential to Bird&#39;s success in Ann Arbor, MI. You will take responsibility for the logistics of the local fleet of e-scooters and e-bikes, ensuring they are charged, safe, and positioned correctly to meet the community&#39;s transportation needs.&lt;/p&gt;
