&lt;li&gt;Recover vehicles for charging or maintenance as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rebalance vehicles by relocating them from low-demand areas to high-demand areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
