&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vehicle Inspection &amp;amp; Basic Maintenance (Daily)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Perform routine inspections to identify damaged, unsafe, or malfunctioning scooters. Ensure scooters meet Bird safety and quality standards before redeployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Route Planning &amp;amp; Operational Efficiency (Daily/Frequent)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Plan and execute efficient collection and deployment routes using Bird systems and operational tools to optimize productivity, reduce downtime, and meet service-level expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Safety Procedures (Continuous Throughout Shift)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Follow all company safety protocols, traffic laws, local regulations, and operational procedures while operating vehicles, handling equipment, and interacting in public spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
